# Worktree refresh defaults (gitserious)

This repo uses the personal global skill `worktree-refresh`, not a project skill.

After a topic PR merges into `origin/dev`, run that skill before the next sibling
worktree. Use these defaults unless the user overrides them:

```bash
export WORKTREE_INTEGRATION="/Users/marky/Documents/Chia/marky++/projects/oss/cli/gitserious-DEV"
export WORKTREE_BASE_BRANCH="dev"
export WORKTREE_PRESERVE=".gitserious,gitserious.toml,gitserious.lock"
```

Example:

```bash
bash ~/.cursor/skills/worktree-refresh/scripts/refresh-worktree.sh \
  /Users/marky/Documents/Chia/marky++/projects/oss/cli/gitserious-feat \
  marky/feat/<name>
```
